Note: bench_function_calls.flow
Note: Hot path measured: function dispatch + var lookup + parameter binding.
Note: Drives a reduce over (range 0 N) that calls a user proc each step.
Note: Tuned iteration count: N = 600000 (200k=1.24s -> 300k=1.38s -> 600k=~2.5s target).

use "@std"

proc work (Int: a, Int: b)
    (add a b)
end proc

Int N = 600000

Int total = (reduce (range 0 N) 0 (fn Int acc, Int i => (work acc i)))

(print (concat "total=" (str total)))
(print "bench_function_calls: PASSED")
